1
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:12,240
We go to work. We pay bills. We scroll. We compete.

2
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:20,093
We call exhaustion adulthood, anxiety responsibility,

3
00:00:21,093 --> 00:00:28,373
isolation independence, and endless accumulation success.

4
00:00:29,373 --> 00:00:34,307
We pretend the picture is coherent.

5
00:00:36,707 --> 00:00:42,067
The body tightens. Attention fragments.

6
00:00:43,067 --> 00:00:47,567
Trust declines. Meaning thins.

7
00:00:49,767 --> 00:00:55,340
An unresolved thought could change sleep,

8
00:00:56,340 --> 00:01:02,980
muscle tension, digestion, attention, and behavior.

9
00:01:05,180 --> 00:01:11,607
Worth becomes achievement. Rest becomes laziness.

10
00:01:12,607 --> 00:01:18,393
Success may bring relief, but only briefly.

11
00:01:19,393 --> 00:01:26,460
A persistent sense that something essential is missing.

12
00:01:28,660 --> 00:01:34,873
You did not choose the body you were born with,

13
00:01:35,873 --> 00:01:42,300
your first language, first household, first fear,

14
00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:47,933
or first explanation of reality.

15
00:01:48,933 --> 00:01:54,293
No one taught you to inspect any of it.

16
00:01:55,293 --> 00:02:00,227
That inheritance is not your fault.

17
00:02:02,427 --> 00:02:08,000
So where does a truthful framework begin?

18
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:14,573
The most immediate fact of your existence

19
00:02:15,573 --> 00:02:19,473
is not a measurement.

20
00:02:20,473 --> 00:02:26,153
It is that you are here to experience one.

21
00:02:28,753 --> 00:02:32,387
[DOT proposes] You are Little c.

22
00:02:33,387 --> 00:02:40,347
[DOT proposes] Your living body is your interface to a Reality Frame.

23
00:02:45,947 --> 00:02:52,053
[DOT proposes] RF₀ is an experience laboratory for Little cs.

24
00:02:54,547 --> 00:03:01,080
Conditioning is real. Conditioning is not essence.

25
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:08,827
What matters is what Little c does with the opening.

26
00:03:09,827 --> 00:03:17,000
Freedom is participation in the creation of possibility.

27
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:31,000
Digital Organism Theory

28
00:03:22,733 --> 00:03:31,000
A school of thought for examining experience.
